{"id": "DfOiMdsRMFM", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Saal bhar shehar mein kaata… aur ab bas ek ticket ka intezaar tha 🚆\n\nPG ki tooti chaarpai pe soya ladka har raat ghar ke sapne dekhta hai: neem ki chhaon, sarson ke khet, chulhe pe roti sekti Maa.\nShehar ne das sikke diye, par ek bachpan le liya. Gaon ka kiwaad aaj bhi khula hai, uski raah dekhta hua.\nAur is baar ticket aa gayi: 08.11. Diwali pe ghar 🪔\n\n🎵 Long Way from Home · MC Square ft. Radhika Bhide · prod. Wicked Sunny (The Local Kid EP)\n@mcsquare7000 @wickedsunnyyyyy @radhiwaves \nMC Square ki Haryanvi aur Radhika Bhide ki awaaz… ghar ki yaad ko isse sachcha kisi ne nahi gaaya.\n\nUsko bhejo jo is Diwali ghar laut raha hai… ya jo laut nahi pa raha 🤍\n\nLong Way from Home | MC Square | Radhika Bhide | Wicked Sunny | The Local Kid | Haryanvi rap | ghar wapsi | Diwali pe ghar | pardes | ghar ki yaad\n\n#LongWayFromHome #MCSquare #viralvideo", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1793596667, "like_count": 1732051, "comment_count": 5512, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2425472638269230a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.323, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNvjpjb5EaiGrUxxh0ZdtMiJD7cLWwXmhiYStg0Wzablw40NZWnaqdp1-pS4mL2smB5WPGZ8sJ4gZg9IxH5QAPelg_2W2HsiR7_Kb8.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdpYClEnIWtQwRttWX9gxj9jduuhX9a-oMsJ4CTas6DHE0aaGiX8fdL8dCViuywEzPqAeVNMrs6nVbCo0mbohrAN&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=VnQeOEJdzr0Q7kNvwFHySyi&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ToC8FZWfLUkDc3T0